1
00:00:00,985 --> 00:00:02,025
(Amy:)Look at this brain.

2
00:00:03,154 --> 00:00:04,944
(Penny:)I don't really want to.

3
00:00:05,865 --> 00:00:07,155
(Amy:)This is us.

4
00:00:07,325 --> 00:00:10,825
(Amy:)Bernadette, you are the analytical,
scientific left hemisphere.

5
00:00:10,995 --> 00:00:13,995
(Amy:)Penny, you're the creative,
spontaneous right hemisphere.

6
00:00:14,165 --> 00:00:16,045
(Amy:)And where's Amy?

7
00:00:16,751 --> 00:00:17,881
(Amy:)She's right here.

8
00:00:18,044 --> 00:00:21,294
The sad little tumor
no one wants to go dress shopping with.

9
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:28,010
Amy, you're not a tumor.
Penny, tell her she's not a tumor.

10
00:00:38,898 --> 00:00:41,358
(Sheldon:)Did you know
that when Alexander Graham Bell...

11
00:00:41,525 --> 00:00:46,905
(Sheldon:)...invented the telephone,
he proposed answering it with "ahoy"?

12
00:00:47,698 --> 00:00:49,528
(Sheldon:)Ahoy.

13
00:00:51,285 --> 00:00:53,035
(Sheldon:)I like it.

14
00:00:56,874 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)Have you been drinking?

